  "scope": "User-requested detailed B appearance; native validation recorded separately",
  "origins": {
    "background": "Built-in image generation referencing user Visual Bible; exact background_prompt.txt; no embedded UI",
    "surfaces": "Original code-authored geometric SVG material/icon assets; build_surfaces.py; independent native labels",
    "tower": "Original editable Godot 3D geometry, no external models or textures; render_tower.gd and tower_scenes/*.tscn",
    "brick_tower": "Original code-authored Godot 3D geometry; no external models or textures. Reproduced with art_source/visual_bible/render_brick_tower.gd; four editable tower_scenes/brick_floor_*.tscn modules and four runtime PNGs share wood camera, lighting, 640x480 canvas, (320,240) anchor and 106.4683685px floor step.",
    "metal_tower": "Original code-authored Godot 3D geometry; no external models or textures. Reproduced with art_source/visual_bible/render_metal_tower.gd; four editable tower_scenes/metal_floor_*.tscn modules, metal_geometry.json, and four transparent runtime PNGs share wood camera, lighting, 640x480 canvas, (320,240) anchor and 106.4683685px floor step. Gunmetal structural framing, mullions and broad glass bays define the facade beyond tint.",
    "crystal_tower": "Original code-authored Godot 3D crystal geometry; no external models or textures. Reproduced with art_source/visual_bible/render_crystal_tower.gd; four editable tower_scenes/crystal_floor_*.tscn modules, crystal_geometry.json and four transparent runtime PNGs share wood camera, lighting, 640x480 canvas, (320,240) anchor and 106.4683685px floor step. Faceted hexagonal columns and restrained cyan/lavender luminous planes distinguish the facade.",
    "brick_arch_part": "Original code-authored Godot 3D brick arch-window variation; no external models or textures. Reproduced with art_source/visual_bible/render_brick_arch_tower.gd; four editable tower_scenes/brick_arch_floor_{entry,wide,mid,top}.tscn modules, brick_arch_geometry.json and four transparent runtime PNGs share brick/wood camera, lighting, 640x480 canvas, (320,240) anchor and 106.4683685px floor step. Faceted voussoirs, keystones and arch-shaped glazing alter structure and silhouette beyond tint.",
    "brick_terrace_part": "Original code-authored Godot 3D limestone terrace and balustrade compositions; no external models or textures. Reproduced with art_source/visual_bible/render_brick_terrace_tower.gd. Four editable entry/wide modules (terrace-only and arch+terrace) and four transparent runtime PNGs share the brick camera/lighting, 640x480 canvas, (320,240) anchor and 106.4683685px floor step.",
    "brick_cornice_part": "Original code-authored Godot 3D projecting limestone dentil cornice with preserved hip-roof silhouettes, stone bands/merlons, and the gold finial/flag from all three matching base roof variants; no external models or textures. Reproduced with art_source/visual_bible/render_brick_cornice.gd. Four editable 640x480 cap scenes and four transparent runtime PNGs share the wood camera/light, (320,240) anchor and 106.4683685px floor step.",
    "brick_landmark_part": "Original code-authored Godot 3D clock-face landmark, with projecting pilasters, plinth and cornice; no external model or texture. Reproduced with art_source/visual_bible/render_brick_landmark.gd. Two editable ordinary-brick and brick-arch mid-floor scenes and transparent runtime PNGs share the brick camera/light, 640x480 canvas, (320,240) anchor and 106.4683685px floor step."
  },
